<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>水火既济 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B0%B4%E7%81%AB%E6%97%A2%E6%B5%8E/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.2</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2026 03:33:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B0%B4%E7%81%AB%E6%97%A2%E6%B5%8E/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>脾土篇第二十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-28/</link><pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 14:22:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-28/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，深入阐述了脾土与各种“火”的关系，特别是&lt;strong&gt;命门之火&lt;/strong&gt;对脾胃生理功能的决定性作用，并论述了“焦土”的病理传变及治法。</description></item><item><title>心火篇第二十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-27/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Dec 2025 13:28:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-27/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过少师与岐伯的对话，系统论述了“心火”（君火）的生理特性、病理传变、心肾相交的机制以及治疗原则，特别强调了“静”的重要性以及肾水对心火的决定性作用。</description></item><item><title>脏腑阐微篇第十六</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-16/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 16:33:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-16/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>文章通过雷公与岐伯的问答，打破了传统“五脏六腑”的定式，提出了**“六脏七腑”**的独特观点，并详细阐释了被忽略的一脏（胞胎）和一腑（包络）的功能与定位。</description></item></channel></rss>